  "id": "spicy-shrimp-and-tomato-scampi",
  "name": "Spicy Shrimp and Tomato Scampi",
  "subtitle": "Penne with chile-spiced shrimp and bright tomato sauce",
  "description": "Tender shrimp simmered with tomatoes, garlic, onion, lemon, and parsley, then served over penne with Parmesan.",
